{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017aEvReyWhGBAcM9NeVhxCG","type":"tool_result","content":"35\tproperty. Run the browser suite with `esbuild test/index.ts --bundle | tapout`;\n36\tinspect inner-button attributes through `el.button` rather than rendered HTML.\n37\t`tapout` always listens on port 8123, so a run fails with `EADDRINUSE`\n38\twhile another worktree's suite is running. Wait for the port to free and\n39\trerun; do not kill the other process.\n40\t\n41\t## Release versioning\n42\t\n43\tFor a release, verify that the manifest version advances the latest published\n44\tversion recorded in `CHANGELOG.md`. The manifest check is part of `npm test`.\n45\t\n46\t## Running the browser suite\n47\t\n48\t`tapout` serves on a fixed port (8123). If another worktree or project is\n49\trunning its suite, `tapout` fails with `EADDRINUSE`; wait for that run to\n50\tfinish instead of killing it.\n51\t\n52\tIf npm blocks install scripts, `node_modules/lightningcss-cli/lightningcss`\n53\tstays a text placeholder and `npm run build-css` fails with\n54\t`This: command not found`. Run `node postinstall.js` inside\n55\t`node_modules/lightningcss-cli` to link the platform binary.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21affb05-e504-467b-b30d-e8595f27f0a7","uuid":"ef2e557b-645f-4383-8a37-9a13b2d79b25","timestamp":"2026-10-30T03:41:42.227Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/button.forward-class-and-aria-label-03-docs-and-release-readiness/AGENTS.md","content":"property. Run the browser suite with `esbuild test/index.ts --bundle | tapout`;\ninspect inner-button attributes through `el.button` rather than rendered HTML.\n`tapout` always listens on port 8123, so a run fails with `EADDRINUSE`\nwhile another worktree's suite is running. Wait for the port to free and\nrerun; do not kill the other process.\n\n## Release versioning\n\nFor a release, verify that the manifest version advances the latest published\nversion recorded in `CHANGELOG.md`. The manifest check is part of `npm test`.\n\n## Running the browser suite\n\n`tapout` serves on a fixed port (8123). If another worktree or project is\nrunning its suite, `tapout` fails with `EADDRINUSE`; wait for that run to\nfinish instead of killing it.\n\nIf npm blocks install scripts, `node_modules/lightningcss-cli/lightningcss`\nstays a text placeholder and `npm run build-css` fails with\n`This: command not found`. Run `node postinstall.js` inside\n`node_modules/lightningcss-cli` to link the platform binary.\n","numLines":22,"startLine":35,"totalLines":56}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017aEvReyWhGBAcM9NeVhxCG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
